/-!
# A097154

Number of iterations of f(x) = reverse(x) - maxdigit(x) needed to reach zero, or -1 if zero is never reached, where maxdig(n) is the largest digit of n.

The 127 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A097154

/-- Known terms of `A097154`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
